# dns
- install unbound, enable service, allow dns in firewall

# in **/etc/unbound/unbound.conf**:
- to make it listen on all interfaces uncomment

interface: 0.0.0.0
interface: ::0

- to allow connection from specific subnet:

access-control: 172.25.5.0/24 allow

- to bypass DNSSEC validation for a specific domain:
    
domain-insecure: example.com

- to forward requests to a specific ip: 
    
forward-zone:
  name: .
  forward-addr: 172.25.254.254

